    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Education and Highways, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission, do by thisOrder, amend the order made under Section 21 of the aforesaid Act, in relation to the establishing of the WayambaUniversity of Sri Lanka, published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 1093/8 of August 17, 1999 (as last amended by Orderpublished in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2037/17 of September 21, 2017), by the addition immediately after the entry\u201cDepartment of Insurance and Valuation\u201d appearing in Column II, which corresponds to the entry \u201cFaculty of BusinessStudies and Finance\u201d appearing in Column I of the Schedule of the following entry :-",
